---
---

<section class="insight" aria-labelledby="insight-heading">
  <div class="insight__inner">
    <div class="insight__card">
      <h2 class="insight__heading" id="insight-heading">
        Did you know you're already fasting right now?
      </h2>
      <p class="insight__body">
        If your last meal was at 7pm and you woke up at 7am, you just completed a 12-hour fast. FastMode picks up where you left off — and shows you what your body is doing while you sleep.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .insight {
    padding: 52px 0;
  }

  .insight__inner {
    max-width: var(--container-max);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 24px;
  }

  .insight__card {
    background: #1E1B18;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-success);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px 28px;
  }

  .insight__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: #F7EFE9;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .insight__body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #C7C2BE;
  }
</style>
